---
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<section class="background-section" id="background" aria-labelledby="background-heading">
  <div class="wrapper background-layout">
    <div>
      <h2 id="background-heading">Background</h2>
      <p class="section-description">Mathematics, electronics and software practice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="background-copy">
      <h3>Education</h3>
      <ul class="education-list">{profile.background.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
      <h3>Computational practice</h3>
      <p>My thesis brought together Python simulations of projections, Fourier-domain filtering and image reconstruction, with reproducible experiments to compare filters under noise.</p>
      <p>Alongside mathematics, I develop Python backend services. I am interested in bringing this experience to reproducible mathematical software and accessible computational tools.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
